# glow_sprite.fmat — a sprite's blend and billboard modes, as a material.
#
# These were `blend:` and `billboard:` enums on every sprite and on every
# particle layer, spelled the same way in two formats and set one object at a
# time. A material is where "what a glow is in this project" lives.
kind: sprite
doc: A light bloom or a spark — adds light, never occludes, needs no sorting.
effects:
  - effect: blend_mode
    mode: additive
  - effect: billboard
    mode: full
  - effect: tint
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.86, b: 0.62}
    intensity: 1.4
